    <string name="str_about_html"><![CDATA[
<h2>🔌 EEPROM Flasher</h2>
<p>Universal Android application for reading, verifying, writing, and erasing EEPROM and Flash memories using native <b>minipro</b> with direct USB Host API connection.</p>
<hr/>
<b>Supported Programmers:</b><br/>
• TL866II+ / TL866A / TL866CS<br/>
• Xgecu T48 / T56 / T76<br/>
• CH341A / CH347 Programmer<br/>
<br/>
<b>Project License:</b> GPLv3 / GPLv2<br/>
<br/>
<b>Open Source Libraries &amp; Credits:</b><br/>
• <a href="https://gitlab.com/DavidGriffith/minipro">minipro</a> — Open source program for TL866 / T48 / T56 by David Griffith &amp; contributors (GPLv3)<br/>
• <a href="https://github.com/libusb/libusb">libusb</a> — Multiplatform USB library (LGPL-2.1+)<br/>
• <a href="https://github.com/mik3y/usb-serial-for-android">usb-serial-for-android</a> — USB serial driver for Android (MIT)<br/>
• <a href="https://github.com/google/material-design-icons">Material Components</a> — UI design system by Google (Apache 2.0)<br/>
<br/>
<b>Developer &amp; Repository:</b><br/>
• <a href="https://github.com/Danielk10/Lector-De-Memorias">EEPROM Flasher GitHub</a><br/>
• <a href="https://github.com/Danielk10/Flash-EEPROM-Tool">Flash-EEPROM-Tool GitHub</a><br/>
• <a href="https://github.com/Danielk10/PIC-k150-Programing">PIC k150 Programming</a><br/>
]]></string>
